@page "/counter"

@* Counter component intentionally renders no visible content. The
   user-facing Counter UI (count display + Click-me button + status)
   lives in App.razor's #counter-shell ABOVE the WaspMarker pair so
   it survives the framework's #80 empty-strings-table render-diff
   wipe. The Counter component still exists for the architectural
   demo — blazor.web.js attaches the SignalR circuit to its marker
   on first page load, satisfying the warmup-once-per-session goal —
   but it has no visible UI of its own. The IncrementCount handler
   stays in case a future build wants to wire it back through the
   slow click path. *@

@code {
    private int currentCount = 0;

    private void IncrementCount()
    {
        currentCount++;
    }
}
